---
import BaseLayout from "../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
import { getCollection } from "astro:content";

const guides = (await getCollection("blog"))
  .filter((post) => !post.data.draft && ["Buy & Sell", "Market"].includes(post.data.category))
  .sort((a, b) => b.data.pubDate.getTime() - a.data.pubDate.getTime())
  .slice(0, 4);
---
<BaseLayout
  title="Ontario Home Value Consultation | Dongho Lee, Broker"
  description="Request a no-obligation Ontario home value and selling-readiness consultation with Dongho Lee, Broker."
>
  <section class="services-hero seller-lead-hero">
    <p class="page-kicker">Sell a Home</p>
    <h1>Sell with a Clear Plan</h1>
    <p class="lead">
      A useful home-value conversation goes beyond an automated estimate. We review recent comparable sales,
      current competition, property condition, timing, and the likely costs of preparing for market.
    </p>
    <p class="lead ko-copy">유용한 홈 밸류 상담은 자동 견적만 확인하는 데서 끝나지 않습니다. 최근 비교 매매 사례, 현재 경쟁 매물, 주택 상태, 매도 시점과 시장 준비 비용을 함께 살펴봅니다.</p>
    <div class="hero-actions seller-hero-actions">
      <a class="button primary" href="/contact/?source=home_value_consultation">Home-value consultation · 홈 밸류 상담 신청</a>
      <a class="button secondary" href="tel:14166258241">Call · 전화 416-625-8241</a>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="conversion-panel" aria-label="How Dongho helps home sellers">
    <div class="conversion-copy">
      <p class="page-kicker">Start Here</p>
      <h2>Your home value is more than an estimate.</h2>
      <p>We start with your property, timing and priorities. Then we review comparable sales, active competition, preparation needs and a practical route to market.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="conversion-actions">
      <a class="button primary" href="/contact/?source=home_value_consultation">무료 홈 밸류 상담 신청하기</a>
      <span>한국어 · English 상담 가능</span>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="services-grid" aria-label="Home selling support">
    <article class="service-card">
      <div class="service-icon">01</div>
      <h2>Prepare <span>매도 준비</span></h2>
      <h3>Property context and priorities</h3>
      <p>주소, 주택 유형, 개선 사항, 현재 상태와 희망 매도 시점을 함께 정리합니다.</p>
    </article>
    <article class="service-card">
      <div class="service-icon">02</div>
      <h2>Price <span>가격 전략</span></h2>
      <h3>Comparable sales and competition</h3>
      <p>최근 거래와 현재 경쟁 매물을 비교해 자료의 의미와 한계를 분명하게 설명합니다.</p>
    </article>
    <article class="service-card">
      <div class="service-icon">03</div>
      <h2>Position <span>시장 포지셔닝</span></h2>
      <h3>Preparation that supports the plan</h3>
      <p>수리, 정리, 연출과 마케팅에서 우선순위를 정해 시장 준비 비용과 시간을 현실적으로 검토합니다.</p>
    </article>
    <article class="service-card">
      <div class="service-icon">04</div>
      <h2>Launch <span>매도 실행</span></h2>
      <h3>Timing, listing and next steps</h3>
      <p>가능한 시점과 상장 전략, 오퍼 검토부터 클로징까지 필요한 다음 단계를 안내합니다.</p>
    </article>
  </section>

  <section class="featured-guides" aria-label="Selling guides">
    <div class="home-section-heading">
      <div><p class="page-kicker">Related Guides</p><h2>Helpful Before You Sell</h2></div>
      <a class="text-link" href="/category/buy-sell/">모든 매매 가이드 보기</a>
    </div>
    <div class="home-posts">
      {guides.map((post) => (
        <article class="post-card">
          <h2><a href={`/${post.slug}/`}>{post.data.title}</a></h2>
          <p>{post.data.description}</p>
        </article>
      ))}
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="services-cta">
    <div>
      <h2>Planning ahead is welcome.<small>장기적인 매도 계획도 좋습니다.</small></h2>
      <p>Whether your timing is three months or two years away, the inquiry form records your timeframe so follow-up can stay appropriate.</p>
      <p class="ko-copy">3개월 후든 2년 후든 예상 시점을 알려주시면 상황에 맞는 주기로 연락드릴 수 있습니다.</p>
      <a class="button primary" href="/contact/?source=home_value_consultation">Start the conversation · 상담 시작하기</a>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
